{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "有人叫住了你",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.chiyuki.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.chiyuki.first",
    "idolId": "chiyuki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（总之得多跑几家……没有浪费的时间。）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "——那个，不好意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好！……诶？……我、我吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "是。突然叫住您，很抱歉。袖子上的扣子快掉了，我在意得不行……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？……啊，真的。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不好意思……谢谢您。让人看到这么不体面的地方……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "呵呵，不会～",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（怎么回事……这个人的笑容，好温柔啊……）",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那个……如果可以的话，让我帮您缝上吧？我带着针线包。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……不不！怎么能让您做到那种地步——",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "可是，已经快掉下来了哦……？请别客气。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那、那就……拜托您了？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "好的。稍微失礼一下哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（还、还是拜托了……被那个笑容带着就……）",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "好了，缝完了♪",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（自然而然就觉得心里暖暖的……）",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……哦哦，一眨眼就好了呢……！真的，不知道该怎么道谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不用，能帮上忙就好。那我就先失礼了……",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，请等一下——",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……呃……突然不好意思……您要不要试试当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "诶？偶像……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "吓到您了吧，抱歉。其实我是做偶像制作人的，正在找新人。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在这里突然说这种话可能很唐突……但我实在被您吸引了！",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "诶、呃……这样啊……不过，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "我在杂货店工作。现在的工作我很喜欢……那种事，还是有点。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在杂货店……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那、那个……不用辞掉现在的工作也没关系。休息日先来上上课也好！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "不……这么突然……",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，至少聊聊！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那个……为什么您会对我，这么上心呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我觉得您一定能成为很棒的偶像。您的笑容，能让很多人打起精神！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "让很多人……我……？",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是的！所以……拜托您了！",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "……您都说到这个份上了……",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "chiyuki",
        "text": "那个……能让我稍微考虑一下吗？我会好好想的。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然！这是事务所的联系方式……我随时都在等，请联络我。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
